{"id":"s5.1.5","slug":"determinants","title":"Determinants of 2x2 and 3x3 Matrices","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">For a $2 \\times 2$ matrix $\\begin{bmatrix} a & b \\\\ c & d \\end{bmatrix}$ the determinant is $ad - bc$: down-product minus up-product.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">For a $3 \\times 3$, expand along whichever row or column carries the most zeros. Along the top row, $|A| = a(ei - fh) - b(di - fg) + c(dh - eg)$ — note the alternating sign.</p><p class=\"mb-4\">If any row is a multiple of another, or a row is all zeros, the determinant is $0$ and there is nothing to compute. Check that first.</p>","summary":"For a matrix the determinant is : down-product minus up-product.","generation_guideline":"Generate a 2x2 or 3x3 determinant with small integer entries.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -3 & -1 \\end{bmatrix}$, then $|A| = $ ______","answer":"-6","kind":"exact","tags":["matrices"]},{"id":2,"text":"If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 4 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -3 & 4 \\end{bmatrix}$, then $|A| = $ ______","answer":"-33","kind":"exact","tags":["matrices"]},{"id":3,"text":"If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 0 & -4 \\end{bmatrix}$, then $|A| = $ ______","answer":"68","kind":"exact","tags":["matrices"]},{"id":4,"text":"If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & -5 \\\\ -5 & 6 \\end{bmatrix}$, then $|A| = $ ______","answer":"-13","kind":"exact","tags":["matrices"]},{"id":5,"text":"If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} -2 & 4 \\\\ -9 & -2 \\end{bmatrix}$, then $|A| = $ ______","answer":"40","kind":"exact","tags":["matrices"]},{"id":6,"text":"If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 1 & -6 \\\\ -8 & 6 \\end{bmatrix}$, then $|A| = $ ______","answer":"-42","kind":"exact","tags":["matrices"]},{"id":7,"text":"If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 5 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -4 & -2 \\\\ -5 & 1 & 0 \\end{bmatrix}$, then $|A| = $ ______","answer":"34","kind":"exact","tags":["matrices"]},{"id":8,"text":"If $A = \\begin{bmatrix} 4 & 1 \\\\ -4 & -5 \\end{bmatri